    "editorial": {
      "mode": "match_review",
      "question": "网球为什么按15、30、40计分？0分为什么叫love？",
      "thesis": "15、30、45的计分最早见于奥尔良公爵查理被囚英国时写的诗（“我已打到四十五；我们押了注，不是白打”）；诗里打的是手掌击球的老式网球，后来发展成皇家网球；钟面说、皇家网球15尺说都只是后人推测，拿不出史料；45怎么变成40也没有原始记载；1877年温网规则写明沿用皇家网球的十五进位计分。love 多数词源学者认为来自“为爱而玩”（不下注、白打）；l'oeuf 说找不到证据。USTA 允许用零一二三代替，ITF 规则没有。",
      "beats": [
        "冷开场：主裁报分 30-15、15-love",
        "最早记载：公爵的诗与皇家网球",
        "两种起源说都只是推测",
        "45 变 40",
        "love 的三种词源与学界倾向",
        "USTA 零一二三",
        "评论区问题"
      ],
      "human_context": {
        "angle": "计分的来历说不清，最早的记载和 love 的词源却都指向“押注还是白打”。",
        "facts": [
          "Charles d'Orléans Ballade 113：J'ay quarante cinq; sur bon gage nous jouons, non pas por neant（British Academy Review 17, Putter 2011）",
          "1877 温网规则：The real tennis method of scoring by fifteens will be adopted（“15, 30, 40”是维基编者注，不是原文）",
          "love 源自 play for love（不下注；OED / Oxford Reference、韦氏、Sheidlower NPR）；韦氏编辑部：l'oeuf 说无证据",
          "USTA Friend at Court：Zero, one, two, three may be substituted for Love, 15, 30, 40（ITF 规则无此条）"
        ],
        "sources": [
          "https://www.thebritishacademy.ac.uk/documents/599/BAR17-07-Putter.pdf",
          "https://archive.org/details/annalstennis00marsgoog",
          "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennis_scoring_system",
          "https://www.etymonline.com/word/love",
          "https://www.alt-usage-english.org/excerpts/fxloveze.html",
          "https://www.npr.org/2026/06/04/nx-s1-5843257/tennis-love-french-open"
        ]
      }
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 117.5,
        "end": 122.71,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "赢一分，十五。再赢一分，三十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/scoring-love-2026/label-w23.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "主裁报分",
            "date": "2023.07.16",
            "place": "温网 决赛",
            "score": "1-6 7-6(6) 6-1 3-6 6-4",
            "people": "阿尔卡拉斯 vs 德约科维奇"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 157.6,
        "end": 160.6,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.5,
            "end": 2.6,
            "text": "Thirty–fifteen.\n三十比十五"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 0.5,
        "end": 5.88,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "第三分，按理该是四十五，主裁喊的却是四十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1199.2,
        "end": 1202.2,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.4,
            "end": 2.6,
            "text": "Fifteen–love.\n十五比零"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1203.5,
        "end": 1207.92,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一分没赢，不叫零，叫 love，爱。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 343.0,
        "end": 350.32,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "网球为什么这么数数？没有标准答案。但线索，能追到六百年前。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 8.0,
        "end": 12.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "最早的线索，藏在一首法语诗里。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 13.0,
        "end": 21.06,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "作者是奥尔良公爵查理。阿金库尔战役被英军俘虏，在英国当了二十五年人质。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 30.0,
        "end": 37.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "诗里，他把人生比作一场球：我已经打到四十五；我们押了注，不是白打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 44.5,
        "end": 50.26,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "他玩的是手掌击球的老式网球，后来发展成皇家网球。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        },
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/scoring-love-2026/label-rt.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_for": 15.0,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "皇家网球",
            "date": "2024.11.25",
            "place": "英国公开赛 决赛",
            "score": "2-6 6-4 6-0 6-5",
            "people": "里维埃 vs 豪厄尔"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 58.5,
        "end": 68.03,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "这是现代网球的祖先，在四面高墙、带斜顶棚的室内球场里打。球打到墙上、顶棚上，都还算活球。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 393.5,
        "end": 399.48,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "可为什么偏偏是十五？流传最广的说法有两个。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 960.0,
        "end": 966.62,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "一个说是钟面：一刻钟十五分，转满一圈六十，正好一局。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "rt",
        "start": 202.5,
        "end": 209.22,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "另一个说法来自皇家网球：发球方每赢一分，就往前站十五尺。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 600.0,
        "end": 605.26,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "两种说法，都只是后人的推测，拿不出史料。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 925.0,
        "end": 929.46,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "那四十五，又是怎么变成四十的？",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 710.0,
        "end": 715.28,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "四十五怎么变成四十，同样找不到原始出处。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1247.5,
        "end": 1254.99,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "能确定的是，一八七七年第一届温网规则写明：沿用皇家网球的十五进位计分。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 785.0,
        "end": 788.07,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "再说 love。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 790.0,
        "end": 795.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "最浪漫的说法，是法语里的鸡蛋，因为零的形状像个蛋。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1050.0,
        "end": 1056.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "可韦氏词典的词源学家说，找不到法语用鸡蛋表示零分的任何证据。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1200.0,
        "end": 1206.31,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "还有人说来自荷兰语，意思是荣誉：为荣誉而打，不为钱。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1243.5,
        "end": 1249.81,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "词源学家更认可的，是英语里的为爱而玩：不下注，白打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1500.0,
        "end": 1505.98,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "巧的是，公爵那首诗里写的，正是押了注，不是白打。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 427.0,
        "end": 436.86,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "嫌绕口？美国网协的规则手册写着：可以用零、一、二、三，代替 love、十五、三十、四十。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 477.9,
        "end": 484.01,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "国际网联的规则里没有这一条。大满贯赛场上，主裁照样喊 love。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23g",
        "start": 1360.0,
        "end": 1365.33,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "几百年过去，来历说不清，这套报分却留了下来。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "w23h",
        "start": 1140.0,
        "end": 1150.13,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "十五、三十、四十，再加一个 love。如果让你改成一、二、三、四，你同意吗？评论区说说。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+10Hz"
        }
      }
    ],
    "mixed_fps": {}
  }
